WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:03.900
Father... your son is only speaking from personal empathy.

00:04.280 --> 00:11.400
Living outside the palace and traveling on state affairs, I often cannot be at your side when you need me,

00:11.840 --> 00:15.500
yet I dare not slacken my duties for even a moment, fearing I might disappoint you.

00:15.880 --> 00:23.400
Now that Yu Gong has committed such treason, exiling him home will bring his father's fury down upon him for renouncing sovereign and sire.

00:23.480 --> 00:30.300
For a scholar steeped in righteousness and propriety, such a punishment is far crueler than the executioner's blade!

00:31.840 --> 00:34.200
Good! Well spoken!

00:34.400 --> 00:41.200
Yu Gong was half a tutor to you, after all. Having him by your side so long, it's only human nature that you cannot bear to part with him.

00:42.080 --> 00:45.500
Very well. Zhen shall grant you an opportunity.

00:50.240 --> 00:55.300
Accompany Zhen in a game of Weiqi. If you win, Zhen shall grant your request.

00:55.920 --> 00:57.300
Thank you, Imperial Father!
